<title>USA: Omniquip to buy Figge's Snorkel unit.</title>
<headline>Omniquip to buy Figge's Snorkel unit.</headline>
<dateline>PORT WASHINGTON, Wis. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omniquip International Inc said Monday it would acquire the assets of Figge International Inc's Snorkel division for $150 million plus assumption of certain liabilities.</p>
<p>Snorkel, which employs approximately 900 people at sites in St. Joseph, Missouri; Elwood, Kansas; Melbourne, Australia; and Levin, New Zealand, reported sales of $158 million for the year ended December 31, 1996.  Figgie acquired Snorkel in 1971.</p>
</text>
